cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the article below."
title: "iam-ids-sdp"
abstract: >-
  Software-Defined Perimeter (controller, accepting and initiating hosts with
  mutual TLS and fwknop Single Packet Authorization) integrating Keycloak IAM
  (multi-factor authentication, role-based access control, session tokens) and
  an Apollon-style intrusion detection system with per-identity behaviour
  analytics. Written in 2026 following the architecture described in the
  article; the article's results were not regenerated with this code.
type: software
license: MIT
